<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"lgsdn-type-lead"} --><p class="lgsdn-type-lead">We aim to collect only what we need to run this website, improve it and understand its value to the community.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__body","layout":{"type":"constrained"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__body"><!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Website feedback</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>You can give feedback without providing your name or email address. If you provide an email address, the website team can use it to reply. Please avoid including sensitive or confidential information.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Feedback is sent to the website administrator by email. The feedback form is configured not to store submissions in the WordPress database. Email delivery and hosting services may retain messages and operational logs.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Measuring website use</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We use Independent Analytics to measure which pages people use, which websites bring them here and roughly which countries visits come from. This helps us improve the website and understand the reach of the network’s work.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>These statistics are stored on our own website. The analytics processes your IP address and basic browser information to estimate location and distinguish visits, without storing your original IP address. We reset the identifier used to recognise repeat visits each day. <a href="https://independentwp.com/knowledgebase/common-questions/what-makes-it-gdpr-compliant/">Read how Independent Analytics processes data</a>.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We do not use analytics cookies. You can stop your visits being counted using the control below. If you do, we save a cookie for one year to remember your choice.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:shortcode -->[lgsdn_analytics_choice]<!-- /wp:shortcode --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Essential website functions</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>WordPress and services used by this website may use cookies for essential functions, including signing in to administer the site. Hosting services may keep security and operational logs separately from analytics.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Questions and requests</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Use the <a href="/feedback/">feedback form</a> to raise a privacy question. Only include information needed to explain your request.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
</div><!-- /wp:group -->